    "matches": false,
    "description": "Expected {\n  a: 2,\n  b: 1\n} but was {\n  b: 1,\n  a: 2\n}. From `orderedObj: {b: 1, a: 2} must equalTo({a: 2, b: 1}),` at line 10 of anonymous.dwl.",
    "reasons": [
      "Expected key with value type Number at (root).b but was not present. From `orderedObj: {b: 1, a: 2} must equalTo({a: 2, b: 1}),` at line 10 of anonymous.dwl.",
